{"id":14851,"artist":"Jody Reynolds / Dolores Nance","title":"ENDLESS SLEEP","lyrics_plain":"%-%-\nThe night was dark, rain fallin' down,\nlooked for my baby, he's nowhere around.\nI traced his footsteps down to the shore,\nafraid he's gone for evermore.\nI looked at the sea, and it seemed to say:\n\"I took your baby from you away.\"\nI heard a voice cryin' in the deep:\n\"Come join me baby in my endless sleep.\"\nWhy did we quarrel, why did we fight?\nWhy did I leave him alone tonight?\nThat's why his footsteps ran into the sea,\nthat's why my baby is gone from me.\nI looked at the sea, and it seemed to say:\n\"I took your baby from you away.\"\nI heard a voice cryin' in the deep:\n\"Come join me baby in my endless sleep.\"\nRan in the water, heart full of fear,\nthere in the breakers, I saw him near.\nReached for my baby, held him to me,\nstole him away from the endless sleep.\nI looked at the sea, and it seemed to say:\n\"You took your baby from me away.\"\nMy heart cried out: \"He's mine to keep.\"\nI saved my baby from that endless sleep.\nI saved my baby from that endless sleep.\nI saved my baby from that endless sleep.%+%+","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] %-%-\n[00:20.36] The night was dark, rain fallin' down,\n[00:24.81] looked for my baby, he's nowhere around.\n[00:29.25] I traced his footsteps down to the shore,\n[00:33.70] afraid he's gone for evermore.\n[00:37.57] I looked at the sea, and it seemed to say:\n[00:42.60] \"I took your baby from you away.\"\n[00:47.07] I heard a voice cryin' in the deep:\n[00:51.52] \"Come join me baby in my endless sleep.\"\n[01:04.82] Why did we quarrel, why did we fight?\n[01:09.25] Why did I leave him alone tonight?\n[01:13.72] That's why his footsteps ran into the sea,\n[01:18.14] that's why my baby is gone from me.\n[01:22.02] I looked at the sea, and it seemed to say:\n[01:27.05] \"I took your baby from you away.\"\n[01:31.52] I heard a voice cryin' in the deep:\n[01:35.96] \"Come join me baby in my endless sleep.\"\n[01: